WEBVTT

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.690
I can't believe this score...

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:11.240
Twenty-two points is nyat bad! It's cute!

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:13.240
It's not cute at all!

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:16.700
Now, now. Let's forget about
how we did on our tests for a sec.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:18.580
The first term is now over!

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.790
The summer vacation we've been
waiting for finally starts tomorrow!

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:27.630
We're now going to leave for our
School Idol Club summer training camp!

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:29.670
Yeah!

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Let's go to the future!</i>
<i>Rainbow melodies</i>

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:42.520
"Nijigasaki High School Idol Club"
"Love Live!"

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.900
<i>The rain clears up and reveals blue skies</i>

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.900
<i>The winds of hope blow (Blowing)</i>

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.870
<i>We can feel something coming</i>
<i>and we take our very first step</i>

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:00.580
<i>The world is sparkling</i>

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:03.580
<i>And our hearts start to well up with (Feelings)</i>

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:07.960
<i>"We want to start running right now!!"</i>
<i>(Move on! Move on!)</i>

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:13.460
<i>The tiny melodies blend together (Our Colors)</i>

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.670
<i>Let's paint this arch, now</i>

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:19.260
<i>It resonates throughout the city</i>
<i>(Reaching for far blue sky!)</i>

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:21.430
<i>Let's sing together!</i>

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:27.230
<i>My feelings are overflowing,</i>
<i>there's no stopping them now</i>

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:29.900
<i>Rainbow-colored passions!!</i>

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:32.110
<i>Colors painted in courage</i>

00:01:32.110 --> 00:01:34.780
<i>Let's create a bridge to the future</i>

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:38.240
<i>Beyond the endless sky</i>

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:40.570
<i>Resounding sympathy</i>

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:42.950
<i>Miracles are blooming</i>

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:46.160
<i>--Let's go! Shine towards the future, melodies</i>

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:48.580
<i>--Yes, I know I'm not alone</i>
<i>--Let's go! Shine towards the future, melodies</i>

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.250
<i>You're all always by my side</i>

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:57.300
<i>So let's connect our dreams together</i>

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:04.350
We're having the training camp...

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:07.560
...at the school?!

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:11.310
Oh, jeez! I thought we were
staying at some villa on the beach!

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:13.650
We can't splurge like that!

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:16.610
This works perfectly fine for a training camp.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:20.820
This is a training facility, so we already have
things needed to spend the night.

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:22.830
Yup, the futons are all ready.

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:23.830
Yup.

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:26.450
I think it's going to be a lovely time.

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:29.120
Rina-chan Board, excited!

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:34.130
Well, we can begin practice tomorrow,
so let's start preparing for dinner.

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:38.760
Wow!

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.010
That smells yummy.

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:42.550
The cheese dip and veggies are ready, too.

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:45.140
The dessert's coming along nicely, too.

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:49.390
Something smells very... unique.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:50.940
It's finished.

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:55.360
Would you like a taste?

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:56.940
S-Sure...

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:00.900
How is it?

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:04.530
Oh? Is it that unbelievably delicious?

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:10.580
Okay, I'm done, too!

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:12.960
Everything looks so good!

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:16.840
Let's dig in!

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:19.260
Here you go.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:21.050
It's so hot!

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.430
This pizza is <i>buono</i>!

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:29.220
I know, right? It's Kanata-chan's
specialty pizza! I even made the crust.

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:31.940
This dip is amazing, too.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:34.400
Crackers go great with that dip, too.

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:37.020
You're right!

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:38.940
Oh, that's--

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:43.530
This is way milder and delicious than it looks!

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:45.530
I'm glad to hear it!

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:46.780
Did you make this, Setsuna-chan?

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:49.660
--I may have adjusted the flavor a bit.
--I did! I'm very proud of this dish!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:56.130
Okay! Now the party's really getting started!

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:06.720
We're having so much fun. I might
forget we're here for a training camp.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:10.720
Let's make tomorrow's breakfast a party, too!

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:13.270
Why don't we all have raw egg over rice?

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:16.020
I love raw egg over rice.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:19.070
Then why don't we also make omelets,
fried eggs, and egg sandwiches

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:20.940
so we can have a full-on eggstravaganza!

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:22.530
That's a great idea.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.410
That sounds great!

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.370
What are you talking about?

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.740
We don't have time for that.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:31.950
The point of this training camp
is to get the extra practice we need

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:35.170
and finalize the details of our concert!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:40.800
A concert... Diver Fes was so amazing!

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.760
I can't wait to stand on the stage!

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:48.970
And when I do, I'll use my Kasumin powers
to make everyone fall head over heels for me!

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:52.060
I'd like to confidently
express myself to the fullest!

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:55.980
I definitely want to relax on top of a bed.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:59.690
I want to show everyone
how punny I am on that stage!

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:03.780
I'd love to hold hands with everyone
who comes and dance!

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:07.740
I want to stream it online so we can
connect with people faraway.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:12.080
I'm going to step it up a notch
from my performance at Diver Fes.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:15.750
And I can't wait to shout out my love.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:20.420
I feel like my heart might burst
just from standing on that stage!

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:24.590
You really are all different.

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:30.350
But I think this concert's going to be amazing.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:34.810
I feel like your personalities will collide
just enough to inspire all of you.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:40.360
Yes. It's because we're so different
that we can pull off

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:42.650
this collection of solo performances.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:45.490
Let's show the world what Nijigasaki can do!

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:46.490
Yeah.

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:50.450
I can't wait to see all of your performances!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:53.910
Hey! What kind of show
do you want to see, Yuyu?

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:58.040
I...

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:02.130
I'm just thrilled to see
all of your performances!

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:07.300
Man, I ate way too much.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:08.760
Come to think of it,

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:14.180
we washed dishes together at summer camp
when we were in grade school, too.

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:16.890
Oh, yeah. When we made curry, right?

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:19.850
No! That was in middle school.

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:21.730
Oh, right.

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:25.190
I guess we're always doing this together.

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:26.320
Yeah!

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:34.030
Hopefully, we'll be together forever.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:35.790
Yeah.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:39.330
I hope you'll look after me, Granny Ayumu.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.920
Oh, stop it, Yu-chan!

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:46.420
Wow! There's all kinds of makeup!

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:48.880
It's fun being able to change up your mood.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:50.220
Wow...

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.590
Now. Now!

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:55.390
Hey, first-years.

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:57.430
Come here a sec.

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:59.060
Gather round.

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:06.820
Huh? Where did Yu-chan go?

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:08.900
Wanna try this one?

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:15.030
Oh, jeez! She left her phone, too.

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:18.660
I haven't seen Kasumi-san
and some of the others, either.

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:22.750
We should all be getting plenty of rest
to prepare for tomorrow's practice.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:25.000
I'm going to go look.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.590
I'll go, as well.

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:27.960
Sure.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:47.190
Ow...

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:49.820
What the heck are you guys doing?

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:55.160
Hey, that sounds fun!

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:59.290
It's not supposed to be fun!
It's supposed to be scary!

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:00.950
Aw, my bad.

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:05.210
But I think you'll need to work harder
if you actually wanna scare anyone.

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:08.300
I see. Production value is important!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:13.090
Actually, your makeup kicks ass, Shizuku!

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:15.260
Kasumi-san approved, too!

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:18.220
She said I'd be able to play
a convincing ghost for my next role!

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:21.930
Way to go, Kasukasu!
You know how to get people hyped up!

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:24.850
My name is Kasumin, not Kasukasu!

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:27.980
--More importantly, Ai-senpai...
--Huh?

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:32.440
Don't think you're getting away that easily.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:42.290
They're all so amazing. They all know
exactly what they want to do.

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:44.620
I wish there was something I could...

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:42.390
Did you get permission to use the music room?

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:46.600
I'm kidding, silly.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:49.610
Jeez! Don't scare me like that!

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:52.900
You've gotten very good at the piano.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:55.570
Nah, I've still got a ways to go.

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:59.990
I wonder if I'll get even better
if I keep practicing.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:04.910
I also practiced singing
and dancing over and over.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:07.370
Over and over... huh.

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:13.630
I guess everything just comes down to practice.

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:15.010
Indeed.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:21.260
Do you remember the last time we talked here?

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:22.220
Yup.

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:28.140
The reason I'm a school idol right now
is because of you, Yu-san.

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:29.850
Huh?

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:32.110
If you didn't say those things to me back then,

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:34.570
I wouldn't have been able to shout out my love

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:37.860
and I'd have let myself be crushed.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:43.240
So thank you for accepting what I love.

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:48.410
It wasn't a big deal!
I just wanted to hear you sing.

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:54.340
Whenever I hear you and
the other girls sing, it gives me energy!

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:58.130
I was so moved back at Diver Fes, too!

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:01.550
I was surrounded by the passion
of the cheering crowd.

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:05.260
I couldn't keep my eyes off that stage.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:09.810
And before I knew it, it was all over.

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:15.770
So is that how you see us, Yu-san?

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:17.070
Huh?

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:21.660
We're only able to see the view from the stage.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:22.870
I see.

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:27.410
Um... Whenever you find the thing you love,

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.960
please allow me to support you.

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:31.210
What I love?

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:35.090
Yes! Whatever you end up loving.

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:42.930
Our school at night seems so strange.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:44.800
You're exactly ri--

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:51.480
Honestly, where did you go, Yu-chan?

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:05.410
--How about this next?
--That's great!

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:06.830
What about this?

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.410
--I think that's great.
--Nice.

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:10.040
Wait, what?

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:20.340
Did you need something?

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:25.970
Wh-What's going on?

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:28.760
What in the world are you doing?!

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:31.180
We need to keep the
fooling around to a minimum!

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:34.400
We were just having a little fun.

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:35.520
Yeah.

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:38.190
You don't need to get that angry...

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.900
I beg your pardon?!

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:45.160
Anyway, we have practice tomorrow,
so let's get some sleep.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:46.370
Yeah.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:48.910
Indeed.

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:12.220
Now I'll show you what true fear i--

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:19.980
Setsuna... Scarlet Storm...

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.030
Wow, she did that in her sleep...

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:25.320
We should just sleep.

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:37.710
Just three more laps!

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:54.310
If we're just going to keep practicing,
this training camp is going to be super boring!

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:58.400
Then how about hearing out my aidea?

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.270
Ai and idea, get it?

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:09.280
Okay, Setsuna-senpai! You're it!

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:11.240
Let's make a run for it!

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:14.580
Hello?! Running and playing tag
aren't the same thing!

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:18.080
--All right! Let's go catch them!
--What?

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:20.580
Yeah! Let's split up and catch them!

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:21.420
Yup!

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:23.420
Wait, no! We should be training!

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:27.300
Oh, come on! You're still running
when you play tag.

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:29.090
Yeah, exactly!

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:31.640
Huh? Please wait a moment!

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:34.100
Come on, Yu! You're running, too!

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:38.440
Hup!

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:42.310
Heh. You're not going to catch me that easily!

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:44.150
You're not getting away!

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:49.150
Hold it right there!

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:51.370
Come back here!

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.080
Hold it!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.620
Wait, you're asleep?

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:01.790
Oh, come on, Kanata-san.
You shouldn't be sleeping here.

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:02.630
Gotcha!

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:03.670
Huh?!

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:07.300
Now I've caught you.

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:12.680
Yup, I'm holding Yu-chan in the club room.

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:14.050
Roger!

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:17.520
Jeez... I can't believe
I actually fell for that.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:20.100
Right when things were getting interesting...

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:29.280
Shinonome...

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:36.870
Touou...

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.880
Find a way

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.540
If I'm with you

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:49.210
It's not so bad being lost

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:55.140
There is no one right answer or shine

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:59.680
Just like a Rainbow Colors...

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.230
Hey, she's totally cool.

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:10.940
Yeah! I'd never seen them before,
but I think I like them!

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:13.910
They didn't even know Karin-san... No.

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:17.660
Despite not knowing about
school idols in general,

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:22.960
most of the people there were cheering for her.

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:24.830
Concerts like that are amazing.

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:27.920
In the middle of the cheers,
everyone up on the stage and in the audience

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:32.680
become one with how much
they love school idols....

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:36.720
We've finally caught everyone.

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:40.060
Great work, everyone.

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:44.060
We basically ran as much
as we would have training.

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:46.020
I'm covered in sweat.

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:48.940
I guess we know what we're doing next, then.

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:56.410
I guess everyone brought
their swimsuits after all.

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:59.990
Looks like you have
a cute swimsuit, too, Setsuna.

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:04.370
Y-Yes, well, you know. Just in case...

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:06.670
All right! Here we go!

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:13.840
You look great in that swimsuit, Yu-chan.

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.260
Really?

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:17.930
Is Kanata-chan sleepy?

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:20.470
Hey! Take that!

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:24.180
Hey! Stop that!

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:32.480
See?

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:35.610
Rina-chan Board, stare...

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:36.610
There!

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:42.660
Say, Yu-chan.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:43.700
Hm?

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:48.250
If things were different, we might've
been going to prep school.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:49.840
Yeah...

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:53.260
But we're still together anyway.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:55.010
Yup.

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:59.430
Do you remember the day we decided
we'd join the School Idol Club?

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:01.680
Yeah, of course.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:05.680
I was so happy when you said you'd see my dream

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:10.810
to become a school idol through with me.

00:18:10.810 --> 00:18:13.400
Dream to become a school idol...

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:19.200
I see. So it's because you found your courage.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:23.620
I chased after your dream with you.
That's how I'm here right now.

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:25.450
Yeah.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:27.830
And everyone else, too!

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:32.670
Our circle is getting bigger,
and before we knew it,

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:37.970
a tremendous power was born
from the people who like school idols.

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:41.010
Thanks, Ayumu.

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:48.060
I'll also be more courageous
and do everything I can right now.

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:50.100
Do everything you can?

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:24.930
For our upcoming concert,
I don't want it to be just Nijigasaki.

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:27.020
I want it to be even bigger.

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:28.310
What?

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:34.110
So the Diver Fes the other day
really was amazing.

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:35.360
And I think it's because of

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:40.610
the thrill that was born from the performers
and the cheering audience becoming one.

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:44.780
And that thrill was overflowing from the venue!

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:50.040
I want to hold a concert
that'll surpass the thrill I felt then.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:55.000
Something that'll surpass all the boundaries
of school idols and fans!

00:19:55.000 --> 00:20:00.510
Niji High, Shinonome, Touou...
It doesn't matter what school!

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:03.510
A concert that's almost like a festival

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:05.640
where anyone who loves school idols
can have a great time!

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:08.560
Encountering school idols
they didn't know about.

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:11.560
Receiving courage from
the passionate cheers of the crowd.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:15.150
Everyone's hearts powerfully
resonating together...

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:17.650
...and forming a new love!

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:22.400
That's the kind of place
I want all of you to sing in.

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:28.870
That, um... sounds really exciting!

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:32.040
Surpassing the boundaries
of school idols and fans...

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:35.580
A concert that's almost like
a festival that anyone can enjoy!

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.500
Festivals... I love festivals!

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:40.800
Yeah, that sounds really fun!

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:43.590
I'd love to stand on a stage like that!

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:44.890
Everyone...

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:49.810
But you really do think of amazing things, Yu.

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.230
But it's going to be a lot of work

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:56.230
if we're going to involve
other schools and the fans.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:59.900
Yeah. Even then, I want to do this!

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:04.860
Because I think there's something
I can do since I'm not an idol!

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:09.120
I want to start something from there, too!

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:13.160
All right! Let's all do our best!

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:15.210
Yeah!

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:29.180
A school idol...

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:30.600
...festival...

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:36.400
A festival for everyone who loves school idols!

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:38.650
The School Idol Festival.

00:21:39.570 --> 00:21:42.990
Let's do this! The School Idol Festival!

00:21:42.990 --> 00:21:45.570
I'm sure we can do this!

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:58.790
All right! Next up is
the pillow-throwing contest!

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:01.090
Bring it on.

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:05.010
Eek! Can we have some handicaps, please?

00:22:19.860 --> 00:22:22.650
<i>As we slowly run down this path</i>

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:26.530
<i>Something is trying to come to life</i>

00:22:26.530 --> 00:22:33.370
<i>I want to tell you, I want to tell you that</i>

00:22:33.370 --> 00:22:36.160
<i>The sky that we look up at every day</i>

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:40.130
<i>Has a blue that changes with the seasons</i>

00:22:40.130 --> 00:22:46.760
<i>There are no rules, it's telling us</i>
<i>to depict it however we please</i>

00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:49.050
<i>Let's not be in a hurry!</i>

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:53.510
<i>Let's enjoy this thrilling time even more!</i>

00:22:53.510 --> 00:23:01.610
<i>Let's all pursue the things that we love</i>

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:05.990
<i>We don't know where we're headed to just yet</i>

00:23:05.990 --> 00:23:09.070
<i>Hopefully, there's an exciting</i>
<i>future awaiting us</i>

00:23:09.070 --> 00:23:13.580
<i>It'd make me happy</i>
<i>if we can both smile about that</i>

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:16.200
<i>Thank you again today</i>

00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:19.460
<i>Now, let us open up our very own maps</i>

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:22.630
<i>And casually take flight</i>

00:23:22.630 --> 00:23:27.920
<i>I want to dream, aspire, and dream once again</i>

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:32.140
<i>I just want to keep dreaming!</i>

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:39.640
Next time, "Everyone's Dream, My Dream."
